---
description: Decide field-level findings for verifySynthesis.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Audit the synthesis against sampled submissions and all identified minority themes, reconcile exact counts, and prepare an accessible report. Preserve methodological limitations and provide traceable examples without exposing unnecessary personal information. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
